cealed Kong (1pt) + Self Drawn (1pt) = minimum 7 points, plus likely All Chows (2pt) = 9+ points\n\nReason: Playing J2 maintains the strongest hand structure with two identical T7-T8-T9 chows while keeping both J1 and J2 pairs flexible. This maximizes my chances of completing a winning hand worth 8+ points with multiple waiting tiles (J1 or J2), while preserving the Pure Double Chow pattern and potential Dragon Pung.\n\nAnswer: Play J2"}
